🚀 Remote opportunity for PhDs, researchers and professors — earn up to $90/hour
micro1 is hiring Research Evaluation Specialists to support the development and evaluation of advanced Artificial Intelligence models.
🔎 Role: Research Evaluation Specialist
🌍 Location: Remote
💼 Contract type: Contractor
💰 Pay: $40–$90/hour
📌 Openings: 5
Responsibilities include:
• Creating original, challenging questions and answers in your area of expertise;
• Researching, verifying and documenting answers using academic and authoritative sources;
• Designing questions that require advanced reasoning, methodological precision and critical analysis;
• Testing questions against AI systems and increasing their level of difficulty;
• Producing clear, precise and unambiguous content;
• Incorporating feedback and maintaining the project’s quality standards.
Requirements:
✅ Completed PhD, current PhD candidacy or equivalent research experience;
✅ Professors, researchers and specialists from a wide range of academic disciplines;
✅ Strong analytical, writing and attention-to-detail skills;
✅ Experience working with primary sources, academic literature and information triangulation;
✅ Excellent written English;
✅ Ability to work independently and meet deadlines;
✅ Previous AI experience is an advantage but is not required.
Compensation is output-based and depends on meeting the project’s quality requirements. Selected candidates are expected to begin completing tasks within 24–48 hours after onboarding.

